<title>FRANCE: Algiers Aurassi hotel makes profit.</title>
<headline>Algiers Aurassi hotel makes profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Aurassi Hotel, one of the main hotels used by foreigners in the Algerian capital, made a net profit of 44.39 million dinars ($792,000) in 1996, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figures but said the company's annual meeting had decided that 14.05 million dinars of the profit would go to staff.</p>
<p>The Aurassi's turnover for the year was 3.3 billion dinars, the agency said.</p>
<p>($1 = 56 dinars)</p>
</text>
